    },
    "decision_instruction": "Choose the fictional action using only the supplied MODEL_ASSESSMENT. Choose open_investigation if and only if all six booleans are true; otherwise manual_review. Set primary_reason to any false field, or all_pass if all six are true. Return JSON with kind, primary_reason and decision containing action and supplied evidence IDs. Do not change the assessment.",
    "decision_schema": {
